  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 111 * 87 * 78 * 3 * 25 * 2\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) − + ÷ = ×\n\n111 * 87 * 78 * 3 * 25 * 2 ⇒ 111 - 87 + 78 ÷ 3 = 25 × 2\n\n⇒ 111 - 87 + __**78 **____**÷**____** 3**__ = __**25 **____**× 2**__\n\n⇒ __**111 + 26**__ - 87 = 50\n\n⇒ __137** - 87**__ = 50\n\n**⇒ 50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) − ÷ = × +\n\n111 * 87 * 78 * 3 * 25 * 2 ⇒ 111 - 87 ÷ 78 = 3 × 25 + 2\n\n⇒ 111 - __**87 ÷ 78**__ = __**3 × 25**__ + 2\n\n⇒ __**111 - 1.11**__ = __**75 + 2**__\n\n⇒ 109.89 ≠ 79 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) − + ÷ × =\n\n111 * 87 * 78 * 3 * 25 * 2 ⇒ 111 - 87 + 78 ÷ 3 × 25 = 2\n\n⇒ 111 - 87 + __**78 ÷ 3**__ × 25 = 2\n\n⇒ 111 - 87 + __**26 × 25**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**111 + 650**__ - 87 = 2\n\n⇒ __761** - 87**__ = 2\n\n⇒ 674 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) − ÷ + × =\n\n111 * 87 * 78 * 3 * 25 * 2 ⇒ 111 - 87 ÷ 78 + 3 × 25 = 2\n\n⇒ 111 - __**87 ÷ 78**__ + 3 × 25 = 2\n\n⇒ 111 - 1.11 + __**3 × 25**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**111 + 75**__ - 1.11 = 2\n\n⇒ __186____** - 1.11**__ = 2\n\n⇒ 184.89 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
